{"id":"aottraitor","lines":[{"t":1.267,"end":3.684,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"You're just tired, that's it right?","de":"Du bist einfach nur müde, stimmt's?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":4.431,"end":5.898,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"Help me out here Bertholdt","de":"Hilf mir mal, Bertholdt.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":6.283,"end":8.933,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"Your nerves are shot.. you don't know what you are saying","de":"Deine Nerven liegen blank. Du weißt gar nicht, was du da sagst.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":9.748,"end":13.381,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertholdt","text":"Huh ... y-yeah. It is the battle getting to me.","de":"Häh ... j-ja. Das liegt noch am Kampf. (zittert)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":13.832,"end":18.749,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"It's okay you are okay, if you really were the armored titan what's the end game here","de":"Schon gut. Falls du wirklich der Gepanzerte Titan wärst – was wäre dann dein Plan?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":19.232,"end":22.199,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"We wouldn't be having this conversation in the first place","de":"Dann würden wir dieses Gespräch doch gar nicht führen.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":22.735,"end":27.985,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"What did you expect me to do, say yes? Let my self be kidnapped just because you asked me politely?","de":"Was hast du erwartet? Dass ich Ja sage? Mich entführen lasse, nur weil du nett fragst?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":29.465,"end":31.682,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"ugh...  hhhhha","de":"(seufzt schwer)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":39.598,"end":43.431,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Right... Not thinking straight am i?","de":"Stimmt ... Ich kann wohl nicht mehr klar denken.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":44.165,"end":46.298,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Barely know that i'am saying here","de":"Ich weiß kaum noch, was ich hier rede.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":48.732,"end":50.649,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Must have got of the deep end","de":"Ich muss völlig den Verstand verloren haben.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":53.898,"end":55.415,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"come on let's go","de":"Komm, gehen wir.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":87.318,"end":88.718,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"That's the problem","de":"Das ist das Problem.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":90.148,"end":91.148,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"huh","de":"Hm.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":92.865,"end":95.815,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"been here too long for my own good","de":"Ich bin schon viel zu lange hier.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":98.448,"end":101.048,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"three years of this madness","de":"Drei Jahre in diesem Wahnsinn.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":101.248,"end":103.665,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"surrounded by idiots","de":"Umgeben von Idioten.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":104.182,"end":105.815,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"we were kids","de":"Wir waren Kinder.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":106.282,"end":107.999,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"what did we know about anything","de":"Was wussten wir schon von irgendwas?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":110.458,"end":113.791,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"why did there have to people like this","de":"Warum musste es hier solche Menschen geben?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":114.748,"end":116.615,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Why Sff*","de":"Warum ... (schnieft)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":117.048,"end":122.981,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Why did i have myself devolved into such a  half ass piece of shit","de":"Warum bin ich zu so einem erbärmlichen, halbherzigen Arschloch geworden?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":123.098,"end":123.781,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"[Suprised sound*]","de":"(keucht überrascht)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":123.932,"end":125.165,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Gah...","de":"(stöhnt)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":125.282,"end":129.199,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"It's too late now, dammed if i know what's right anymore","de":"Jetzt ist es zu spät. Ich weiß verdammt noch mal nicht mehr, was richtig ist.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":130.365,"end":137.482,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Who cares, it is what it is, no choice but to face what i've done","de":"Was soll's. Es ist, wie es ist. Ich muss mich dem stellen, was ich getan habe.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":137.885,"end":143.852,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"as a warrior no road left but the one that leads to the end","de":"Als Krieger bleibt mir nur noch der Weg bis zum bitteren Ende!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":143.702,"end":148.269,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"(gasps in shock)","de":"(keucht fassungslos)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":148.282,"end":152.632,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertholdt","text":"Reiner! Right now? Here? We're doing this?","de":"Reiner! Jetzt? Hier? Wir machen das wirklich?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":152.648,"end":157.398,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"Yes, right here right now we settle this once and for all","de":"Ja! Hier und jetzt bringen wir das ein für alle Mal zu Ende!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":157.398,"end":158.365,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"Ugh","de":"(keucht)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":158.293,"end":159.41,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"huh?","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":159.915,"end":160.832,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"AGH","de":"(Angriffsschrei)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":160.665,"end":161.582,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"UGHH","de":"(stöhnt vor Schmerz)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":161.482,"end":163.915,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"hhhhh... ugh aaaa","de":"(atmet schwer, schreit)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":163.624,"end":164.824,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertholdt","text":"ahh a","de":"(schreit vor Schmerz)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":168.115,"end":169.315,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertholdt","text":"ughhh aa [bleeding out*]","de":"(röchelt vor Schmerz)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":169.598,"end":172.131,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"EREN GET OUT OF HEREEEE!","de":"EREN! VERSCHWINDE VON HIER!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":172.782,"end":174.582,"chars":[3],"who":"Mikasa","text":"(gasps and groans)","de":"(keucht und stöhnt)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/39.mp3"},{"t":174.698,"end":175.648,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertholdt","text":"(whimpers)","de":"(wimmert)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/40.mp3"},{"t":175.382,"end":176.432,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"BERTHOLD!","de":"BERTHOLDT!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/41.mp3"},{"t":176.348,"end":181.215,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"(gasps, stunned)","de":"(keucht wie erstarrt)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/42.mp3"},{"t":182.148,"end":184.931,"chars":[4],"who":"Armin","text":"EREN! RUN AWAYYYYYY!","de":"EREN! LAUF WEG!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/43.mp3"},{"t":197.982,"end":199.982,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"(gasps)","de":"(keucht)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/44.mp3"},{"t":201.148,"end":204.515,"chars":[2],"who":"Bertholdt","text":"[Colossal titan scream*]","de":"(brüllt als Kolossaler Titan)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/45.mp3"},{"t":202.898,"end":206.831,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"(gasps and screams)","de":"(keucht und schreit)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/46.mp3"},{"t":217.948,"end":219.098,"chars":[4],"who":"Armin","text":"[Tss*]","de":"Tss!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/47.mp3"},{"t":229.798,"end":230.615,"chars":[4],"who":"Armin","text":"Nooo","de":"Nein!","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/48.mp3"},{"t":238.827,"end":243.694,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"[Crying*]","de":"(weint)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/49.mp3"},{"t":243.715,"end":250.365,"chars":[0],"who":"Reiner","text":"I'm going to return to the home that was taken from me... I will do it... No matter what","de":"Ich kehre in die Heimat zurück, die man mir genommen hat. Ich werde es tun. Egal, was passiert.","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/50.mp3"},{"t":257.232,"end":258.432,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"Bertholdt","de":"Bertholdt ...","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/51.mp3"},{"t":259.593,"end":265.093,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"Reiner [Crying*]","de":"Reiner ... (weint)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/52.mp3"},{"t":265.898,"end":271.031,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"(bites his arm) Damn you! YOU TRAITORS! (screams)","de":"(beißt sich in den Arm) Verdammt! IHR VERRÄTER! (schreit)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/53.mp3"},{"t":271.282,"end":275.882,"chars":[1],"who":"Eren","text":"[Attack titan screams*]","de":"(brüllt als Attackierender Titan)","orig":"scenes/aottraitor_v918/lines/54.mp3"}]}
